# Added 2026-04-19 for r7.5-hermes-prerelease — session-state files
# Ephemeral per-conversation artifacts (progress trackers, session handoffs).
# If one of these ever needs to ship, commit with `git add -f <path>`.
PROGRESS.md
HANDOFF-*.md
SESSION_LOG.md
SESSION-*.md

# Exception: Hermes variant's campaign-handoff tree contains DURABLE handoff
# docs (not ephemeral per-conversation artifacts). Commit those.
!variants/hermes/campaign-handoff/
!variants/hermes/campaign-handoff/HANDOFF-*.md

# Probe infrastructure backups — session-local one-time snapshots.
# Naming convention: <script>.pre-<revision>-orig or .probe-*-orig
*.pre-*-orig
*.probe-*-orig

# Local tmp + logs for probe runs (project-directory ephemera — NOT the
# Hermes campaign tmp-archive, which is tracked under variants/hermes/archive/*/tmp-archive/)
/tmp/probe-*

